OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry, rather chilly start
OL,6,Facross the south and east with some
OL,7,Flong sunny spells. However, showers
OL,8,Facross the north and west develop more
OL,9,Fwidely this morning and become
OL,10,Foccasionally heavy this afternoon.
OL,11,FFreshening northwesterly breeze.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers becoming confined to
OL,14,Fcoasts this evening before dying out
OL,15,Fovernight. Long clear spells
OL,16,Fdeveloping and, with winds falling
OL,17,Flight, a touch of frost is possible in
OL,18,Fwell sheltered spots.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
