OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA bright start but cloud
OL,6,Fsoon increasing from the west bringing
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain to most places by
OL,8,Fmidday. The rain becoming occasionally
OL,9,Fheavy in the afternoon. Strengthening
OL,10,Fsoutherly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain
OL,13,Fclearing overnight then sunny spells
OL,14,Fand blustery heavy showers Friday and
OL,15,FSaturday, the showers easing later
OL,16,FSaturday. Mostly dry and bright
OL,17,FSunday, some rain may reach western
OL,18,Fcounties later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
